# xpacespace TEAMS V52 — Web + Android App Release

V52 hardens V51 into a release-oriented web/PWA build suitable for web-to-APK wrappers.

## Fixed
- Real Graze Space form is wired to Firebase Storage + Firestore moderation queue.
- Admin Graze queue uses realtime snapshot; submission notifications are generated by the Firebase function.
- Direct chat Firestore rules correctly separate read/create/update semantics.
- Task assignment now loads verified crew into a native datalist and falls back to username lookup/index.
- Task list no longer depends on a composite Firestore index.
- Mobile vertical touch scrolling and nested chat/drawer scrolling hardened.
- Pending crew accounts stay in Home/Profile and operational sections remain locked.

## V52 experience
- XPACE Command palette
- Notification center
- PWA/standalone Android metadata
- Direct crew chat
- XPACE Pulse
- XP/level progression UI
- Offline service-worker foundation
- Mobile safe-area / touch architecture
- Crew, missions, projects, tasks, Graze, files, search and admin controls

Firebase project remains `teamxpacex`. Deploy Firestore/Storage rules and Cloud Functions when publishing the backend.
